CORE
array_of_multiple_indices.c

Passing problem to incremental SMT2 solving
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
Exercises an array_of (via __CPROVER_array_set) read at multiple distinct
nondet indices. With the constant-array encoding the array is defined once and
every index is constrained, so the reads agree. Unlike the previous forall
encoding, this needs no --slice-formula workaround.
See GitHub issue diffblue/cbmc#8061.
